WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.830
How about this one?

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:06.180
Nope. It's too girlish for a yacht.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:07.480
What about this one?

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.340
Mmm... Not good enough, just too ordinary...

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.770
What about this? You'll be a star!

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.140
Isn't it too childish?

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:21.220
Well... You're right. It looks like <i>Shichi-go-san</i>.

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.370
Be a bit more serious, please!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:28.630
I'm jealous! A party aboard a yacht...!

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.910
Then dinner at a restaurant overlooking the beach...

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.920
That yacht is Miya-sama's family boat!

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.200
Hieeee! <b> </b>

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.810
Hieeee! "Hieeee" is right!

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:39.190
Brother, Dear Brother;

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.460
Mid-terms are over.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.340
With lightened hearts, we went shopping.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:49.860
Tomoko was helping me find a dress for the Sorority party.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:51.840
Now really... <b> </b>

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:52.570
Now really... Mmm?

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.930
This is the end of mid-term break.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:56.990
Yes...

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.940
Tomorrow the results get posted on the wall,

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:02.890
...listing everyone from the first in the class,

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:05.640
...all the way down to number two-hundred-something...

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:06.730
I know.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.420
I'm aiming for a little above the middle.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:14.240
"Not to stand out, nor be looked down upon", is my motto.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:18.030
But it's not the same for you, Nanako.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:22.050
You need to rank in the top 50 to stay a Sorority member, right?

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.050
Yes.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:28.960
But thank God! I'm so grateful now that I wasn't "Sorority Quality".

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:36.520
Nanako, you'll be OK! I guarantee it.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:41.820
You're smart! You'll be 43rd, no... 38th...

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:46.180
My predictions are pretty good! You could call me "the Psychic Girl".

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:50.320
Anyway, my Dear Brother... mid-terms are over now.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.720
The glare of the sun grows stronger each day,

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:58.070
...and I sense that the season is about to change...

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:04.470
<b>15. Fukiko; The Sea Rumbles</b>

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:22.360
Nanako! There you are!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.640
You made it! You easily made the top 50!

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.990
Oh! Shinobu-san, you made it, too!

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.060
What a relief!

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:39.300
Junko, it's OK... considering the circumstances...

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.140
Nakaya-san...

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:50.130
What happened to her? She's been at the top since Junior High...

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.950
Yes... she's the one who had a high fever on the first day of mid-terms.

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.160
...and was hardly even able to write her name.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.560
Even then she did pretty well... placing in the top 70.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.790
Top 70? That's still better than me...

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:11.940
[We had been digging in silence perhaps an hour and a half,]

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.220
[...when the dog began to bark loudly...] <b> </b>

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.690
[...when the dog began to bark loudly...] Nothing else will happen now.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.340
Mid-terms are over.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.830
Now, 3 months after entering Seiran,

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:24.170
...I must admit that I'm getting more used to it.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.120
Nothing else will happen now,

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.670
...or at least, I won't let anything overwhelm me again.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.880
I'm finally feeling more confident.

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:36.110
The matter of Saint-Juste-sama and Miya-sama,

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.630
...and Kaoru-no-Kimi's health...

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:45.600
...even though I may not fully understand these things,

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:50.550
...I think perhaps I am finally becoming more fond, bit by bit,

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:53.640
...of Seiran's solemn buildings and foreboding trees.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.140
Nevertheless, something happened that afternoon

00:05:57.150 --> 00:06:02.300
...at the Sorority House, something I couldn't accept.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:10.450
We will now commence this emergency session of the sorority.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:14.950
The agenda concerns our Sorority's standings in the mid-term exams.

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:17.560
The chairperson will be Ichinomiya Fukiko-san.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:22.430
Brother, it was as if a verdict were being delivered at a trial.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.960
It was as pitiless as the sentencing of a criminal.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.260
Junior member Nakaya Junko-san of section C...

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:34.670
Please stand.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.670
Nakaya-san, stand up.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:39.740
OK.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:51.180
It is regrettable we had to convene this emergency session,

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:54.860
...just so we could deal with your case.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:58.430
Yes. I am very truly sorry.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:05.960
First foreign language -- placed 56th; second foreign language 48th;

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:10.510
Literature 77; politics and economy 63;

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:14.670
Mathematics 82; sociology 85;

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:19.760
Statistical analysis 38. The total result -- 73rd.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.600
Is that correct, Nakaya-san?

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:24.560
Yes, that's right.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:26.500
This is a disgrace.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:31.080
All our members placed in the top 50 of their class.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.490
Except you.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:35.000
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.630
You know the sorority rules, right?

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:38.430
Yes!

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.870
It's unfortunate you couldn't meet our standards even for one term.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.260
Yes.

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:48.080
However, since it would be heartless to expel you so abruptly...

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:50.820
Miya-sama...?

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:55.440
...you have one week to resign voluntarily.

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:09.550
The next scheduled meeting is in two weeks.

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:14.030
Miya-sama! Miya-sama, I beg you!

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:16.100
I promise that I'll do really well on the finals...

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:20.460
Please wait until then! Please!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:27.880
The resignation may be mailed... attention to me.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:37.760
Kiryu-san, Hayashida-san, please vouch for me!

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:41.040
Tell her I had a high fever during the mid-terms!

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:48.650
It's true! It's true, Miya-sama!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.390
Nakaya-san was really, really sick!

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:04.250
Wouldn't you reconsider her case?

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:10.810
Besides, it's not fair to pass judgment based on only a single test period.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:13.160
Yes, really! It's... it's...

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.360
That's very high-minded of you.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:23.050
But Sorority members are responsible for their health as well.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:27.100
There's no excuse for these shameful results.

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:32.940
This touches upon the pride of the Sorority. Do you understand?

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:38.520
Furthermore, I wonder if you realize who arranged for YOUR admission...!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:56.510
Come on now! Listen to me!

00:09:56.510 --> 00:10:01.130
Like I keep telling you, you mustn't oppose the will of Miya-sama!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.410
Furthermore, I wonder if you realize who arranged for YOUR admission...!

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:10.600
Don't you realize what a mistake it would be to make Miya-sama angry?

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:16.420
Listen... why not take her some of her favorite red roses?

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.430
Don't you think you should apologize to her?

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.200
What did she mean?

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:30.770
Wasn't I admitted on my own merit?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:34.660
I wonder if you realize who arranged for YOUR admission...!

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:38.910
"Who?" Who was it? Who?

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.780
You understand why, don't you...?

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:50.670
You didn't even attend the party.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:52.880
You shouldn't have been chosen.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.630
We won't permit such an injustice!

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:57.220
Injustice? <b> </b>

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.430
Injustice? There was no injustice!

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:04.070
If not by an injustice, how could it have happened?

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:07.070
I don't know how it happened!

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:08.420
Damn you!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:12.920
Take it easy! Hey!

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.610
Yes! It's amazing!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.090
There were fifteen candidates.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.360
What kind of dirty tricks did you use?

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.570
You didn't even attend the party!

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.830
This is impossible!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.240
I can't agree with this! It isn't fair!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:50.230
I don't know what to do for this party.

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.390
Yes indeed! It's at the beach.

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.400
I have sensitive skin...

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:01.900
The skin's worst enemy is actually salt.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.100
That's true!

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:06.500
Mona-Lisa-sama, Vampanera-sama...

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.020
Oh, Nakaya-san...!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.890
You're a bad girl.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.280
Freshmen shouldn't come to a place like this.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.900
I'm sorry... I came all this way to speak to you...

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:22.450
...and... both of you have been so kind to me... and...

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.120
What do you want?

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:30.990
Could you... could you ask Miya-sama to reconsider? Please?

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:35.510
I'm sorry, but doing such a thing would reflect badly on us.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.020
You understand...

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:39.890
Let me treat you to some tea...

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:43.260
No thank you.

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:52.310
Miya-sama! Miya-sama! Miya-sama...!

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:57.690
Red roses... Please, Miya-sama!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.540
Miya-sama...!

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:51.430
You know, my father has a yacht, too! Not quite as big though...

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:55.530
...but I'll ask him to take all of us out, Tomoko and you and I...

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:12.270
Nanako-san!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.520
What's the matter with you, Nanako-san?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:19.990
Nakaya-san didn't show up.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:22.820
Isn't she on her way out, anyway?

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.840
I've really been looking forward to today's party.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.750
Mid-terms are over now.

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.000
Everyone was looking forward to it.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:33.030
Nakaya-san was too, I would imagine...

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:35.000
Listen, what are you thinking?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.750
You'd better worry about yourself instead of her.

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:40.760
Did you apologize to Miya-sama?

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.200
Did you bring red roses to Miya-sama as I suggested?

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:45.890
Miya-sama...

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:46.910
Yes.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:50.330
Nakaya-san was expelled solely on Miya-sama's authority.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:51.000
What?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.990
In that case... could it have been on her authority...

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.610
...that I was selected for the Sorority?

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.350
Why? Why?

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:03.020
I don't know. I don't know that.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:07.930
Until now... I'd thought I was elected fairly...

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:12.060
...By open voting... though there might have been a little something else...

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:15.160
...Still, that was what I tried to believe.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.020
Finally, just a little...

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:21.770
...I was beginning to feel some confidence, here at Seiran.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:26.250
Here, I'm going to open the champagne! Let's toast!

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:37.300
These are the people whose birthdays are this month...

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:39.840
Kiryu-san, Suzuka-san, and Ukawa-san...!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.070
What a nice breeze.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:31.220
Yes.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.170
Haven't you been worrying?

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:42.040
...about what I said the other day?

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:48.240
Well, I... Yes.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:53.170
Don't worry about it.

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:56.790
Your selection as a sorority member was done fairly.

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:34.480
I'm sorry. I regret what happened.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:39.420
I got upset when you talked back, and I acted meanly.

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:43.310
It's true that your recommendation came from me,

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:47.260
...but you were chosen by all the sophomore's votes.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:48.710
That's the truth.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.230
It was rather cruel of me to say such a thing...

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:57.400
...knowing that you'd been hurt by rumors already.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:17:59.930
Won't you forgive me?

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:02.360
What? Asking me to forgive...?

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.210
Your hair is so soft...

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:11.270
Ummm....

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:13.350
And you are so pretty...

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:33.170
Her snow-white, almost translucent skin...

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:37.070
And the cool, faraway gaze that is sometimes in her eyes...

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:41.810
She looks somewhat like...

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.080
...Somewhat like Saint Juste.

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:46.700
Maybe they are indeed sisters,

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.560
Fukiko-sama and Saint-Juste-sama.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.640
My Dear Brother...

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:55.000
These many dimensions of Miya-sama I saw tonight,

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.550
...are even more complex and mysterious

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:00.960
...than those of Saint-Juste-sama,

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:06.860
...darker than midnight, yet even sorrowful, as well...

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:10.590
Nanako-san.

00:19:15.310 --> 00:19:16.180
Nanako-san?

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:20.070
Misonoo-san!

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:22.140
Yes?

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:26.710
Though I doubt that you would...

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:33.610
...might you happen to have a boyfriend you are seeing?

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:44.550
Well... I have a pen-pal... I asked him to be like my brother...

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:47.460
You do? I see.

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:59.030
Cease at once. It's too early for you.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:00.480
But...

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:01.890
Cease.

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:10.060
You understand?

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:12.670
Ye -- yes...

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:16.320
My dear Brother, I'm sorry.

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:19.530
All I said was "yes".

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:23.260
It's not right, even from Miya-sama.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.980
Deciding to whom I will write is something only I can do.

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:30.390
...as well as deciding who shall be my pen-pal.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:33.760
I'll still write you... of course!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:37.040
All I have to do is to not tell her...

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:40.330
...and there's no way she can find out.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:45.880
So, why would she make such a demand?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:06.580
So, had enough? You "Yacht-Girl"...!

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:09.460
Bingo!! I just got back!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.200
...And finished changing!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:13.280
Let's have a report! What's new?

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:15.830
Anything happen? Any gossip?

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.710
Ummm... there was something.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:19.980
I mean, yes and no...

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:22.910
So it was sort of so-so?

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:26.690
Yes... so-so. The ocean breeze was tiring.

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:29.840
Oh! Sorry! I have to go!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.790
I'll call you back.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.610
Darn interruptions...

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:40.310
Nanako, where are you going? It's late!

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:43.070
To see a friend! Up around the corner...

00:21:58.480 --> 00:21:59.490
Nakaya-san.

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.320
I'm sorry to call you so late.

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:05.070
I really needed to talk to you.

00:22:07.460 --> 00:22:10.610
I decided to leave the sorority.

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:15.070
Today I sent my resignation to Miya-sama. By express mail.

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:16.300
Nakaya-san!

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:19.220
I've looked longingly at the Sorority for so long...

00:22:19.220 --> 00:22:23.440
...since I was in Junior High... and even before.

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:26.490
Such beautiful Sisters...

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:30.370
And such chosen, fortunate people... so splendid and magnificent.

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:35.060
Surely, I thought, their character had a goodness to match their beauty.

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:40.120
I can't explain how it changed, but now it seems more like a fantasy.

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:46.840
It's been only three months since I joined the sorority,

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:49.720
but was there anything good that happened to me, I wonder?

00:22:51.530 --> 00:22:52.600
My dear Brother...!

00:22:58.680 --> 00:23:03.170
To tell the truth, I've resented you a little.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:05.670
Because Miya-sama seemed to favor you.

00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:08.520
I'm sorry.

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:09.760
It's OK...

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:14.780
Here - this is a flower that will never die.

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:19.070
Thank you. For speaking up for me.

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:24.770
I'm so grateful. I won't ever forget it.

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:27.460
Bye!

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:30.400
Nakaya-san!

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:32.940
I don't like the sorority that much, either!

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:41.830
My Dear Brother...

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:47.510
This season, a season of fairy tales, has come to an end.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:01.090 --> 00:25:02.960
Preview

00:25:03.500 --> 00:25:05.440
On the day of the basketball game,

00:25:05.440 --> 00:25:09.660
Kaoru-no-Kimi suffers a bloody foul and must leave the court.

00:25:10.490 --> 00:25:15.180
Mariko then panics and follows Kaoru-no-Kimi to the hospital.

00:25:15.320 --> 00:25:19.800
There, Kaoru-no-Kimi's words bring tears to Mariko's eyes.

00:25:20.600 --> 00:25:21.540
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:21.540 --> 00:25:22.550
Next episode: <b>Comeback</b>

00:25:22.820 --> 00:25:24.420
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:24.420 --> 00:25:28.850
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
